{"title":"Around The World","artist":"A Touch Of Class","sourceId":"reference:607cIoqDsHy57JHLdph2","sourceHash":"3cc03cd0e3dda556ffdb1e3442ad8f72c122a21efe246eaaf69a68c04fdd249d","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.23,"end":10.23,"text":"The kisses of the sun were sweet, I didn't blink","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":10.82,"end":13.82,"text":"I let it in my eyes like an exotic dream","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":14.47,"end":17.47,"text":"The radio playing songs that I have never heard","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":17.99,"end":20.0,"text":"I don't know what to say","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":20.0,"end":21.31,"text":"Oh, not another word","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":21.31,"end":23.82,"text":"Just la la la la la","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":23.82,"end":25.12,"text":"It goes around the world","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":25.12,"end":27.4,"text":"Just la la la la la","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":27.4,"end":28.79,"text":"It's all around the world","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":28.79,"end":31.16,"text":"Just la la la la la","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":31.16,"end":32.66,"text":"And everybody's singing","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":32.66,"end":35.14,"text":"La la la la la","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":35.14,"end":36.21,"text":"And now the bells are ringing","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":36.21,"end":38.37,"text":"La la la la la","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":38.37,"end":40.01,"text":"La la la la la la la","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":40.01,"end":42.12,"text":"La la la la la"